    {
      "id": "cb-mr-bones-6h0k1y",
      "text": "One win doesn't make you cardio-cleared, Voss. Your serum might raise the dead, but it won't raise those dice for you tonight. Bring your gold - I'll add it to the ledger under \"regrets.",
      "speaker": {
